        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The committee shall establish its own operating procedures. However, Union representatives on the committee shall be given a reasonable amount of time during working hours to investigate safety and health hazards brought to the committee and to serve on this committee.",
            "block_bbox": [
